      "type": "text",
      "text": "Chickenpox in children 2 yr and older: acyclovir 20 mg/kg per dose 4 × daily for 5 days (over 40 kg: adult dose)."
     }
    ]
   },
   {
    "type": "paragraph",
    "attrs": {
     "indLeft": 18,
